# CardiosensAI device topics (docs/device-protocol.md). Mosquitto reads this; it isn't secret.
# A device logs in with its device ID as username (and client id) and may only use its own topics:
#   publish   cs/d/<id>/up          (signed messages to the server)
#   subscribe cs/d/<id>/down/#      (retained state + acks from the server)
pattern write cs/d/%u/up
pattern read cs/d/%u/down/#

# The bridge (app/scripts/mqtt_bridge.py) reads every device's uplink and writes every device's downlink.
user cs-server
topic read cs/d/+/up
topic readwrite cs/d/+/down/#
